[00:19.24]1. The living God, Jehovah, you have proved to be;
[00:28.74]Your mighty works abound
[00:33.62]in earth and sky and sea.
[00:38.10]No rival god can equal what you have done
[00:44.94]—there is none.
[00:48.76]Our foes will be consumed.
[00:57.36](Chorus)
[00:57.36]Jehovah provides escape for the loyal.
[01:06.90]His servants will see what a mighty Crag is he.
[01:15.92]So with courage and faith in our God,
[01:21.72]we spread the fame
[01:25.16]Of Jehovah, our Source of escape,
[01:31.40]and praise his name.
[01:52.36]2. Though ropes of death encircle me, I call to you,
[02:00.92]“Jehovah, give me strength,
[02:06.62]and give me courage too.”
[02:11.10]From your own temple dwelling, you hear my plea,
[02:18.86]“Shelter me;
[02:22.04]Rescue me, O my God.”
[02:30.46](Chorus)
[02:30.46]Jehovah provides escape for the loyal.
[02:39.50]His servants will see what a mighty Crag is he.
[02:48.30]So with courage and faith in our God,
[02:54.62]we spread the fame
[02:58.16]Of Jehovah, our Source of escape,
[03:03.62]and praise his name.
[03:13.76]3. From heaven you will thunder
[03:32.12]and give forth your voice.
[03:37.94]Your enemies will quake;
[03:41.58]your servants will rejoice.
[03:46.62]You prove to be whatever you need to be;
[03:54.60]all will see
[03:56.28]How you provide escape.
[04:06.20](Chorus)
[04:06.20]Jehovah provides escape for the loyal.
[04:16.72]His servants will see what a mighty Crag is he.
[04:26.00]So with courage and faith in our God,
[04:31.78]we spread the fame
[04:37.82]Of Jehovah, our Source of escape,
[04:42.32]and praise his name.
